Key Implementation Highlights
Exact Document Reproduction: The AssessmentPaper component closely matches the reference image with:
Centered institutional header with logo
Four-column observation checklist table
Task sections with merged headers
Subcriteria with bullet indentation
Subtotal rows per task
Grand total with dynamic percentage calculation
Assessment outcome with checkboxes
Feedback sections and signature lines
Dynamic Calculations: The calculations.js module handles all mark validation and computation server-side to prevent manipulation.
Three-Page Structure: The PDF generator creates exactly three pages matching the reference layout, with automatic page numbering.
Security: Row Level Security policies ensure assessors can only modify their own in-progress sessions, and verification prevents self-verification.
Audit Trail: All changes are logged with old/new values for compliance.
Scalability: The system supports unlimited tasks, criteria, and subcriteria while maintaining the official document structure.